{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>That you say to me.</b> That you say to me: carry him in your bosom. And where did He say this to him? ״לֵךְ נְחֵה אֶת הָעָם״ (Exodus 32), and it says ״וַיְצַוֵּם אֶל בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל״ (ibid.) — on condition that they would stone you and revile you (Sifrei)." "<b>Unto the land which You swore to their fathers.</b> You say to me to carry them in my bosom."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:20.249792403Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}